
## Hotwire

- **Frontend:** Hotwire (Turbo + Stimulus)
- **JS bundling:** {{JS_BUNDLING}} <!-- importmap / esbuild / vite / webpack -->
- **Stimulus controllers:** {{STIMULUS_PATH}} <!-- app/javascript/controllers/ or app/frontend/controllers/ -->
